# Using `$route`

In the component, you can access the current route object:

```javascript
export default {
  data() {
    return {
      userId: this.$route.params.id
    }
  }
}
```

Or with Composition API:
```javascript
import { useRoute } from 'vue-router'

const route = useRoute()
const userId = route.params.id
```

⚠️ The `$route` object is reactive – when the route changes, your component will update accordingly.
